request.description:
Check user's virtual account status.

Use this to determine whether to show the VA creation prompt on the wallet page.

**Response (no account, not declined - show prompt):**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "has_account": false,
    "declined": false,
    "account": null
  }
}
```

**Response (has account - show details):**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "has_account": true,
    "declined": false,
    "account": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "account_number": "7353333250",
      "bank_name": "Wema Bank",
      "email": "user@example.com",
      "is_active": true,
      "created_at": "2025-01-15T10:00:00Z"
    }
  }
}
```

**Response (declined - don't show prompt):**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "has_account": false,
    "declined": true,
    "account": null
  }
}
```

**Frontend Logic:**
- `has_account: true` → Show account details
- `declined: true` → Don't show prompt
- Both false → Show creation prompt

Get the user's virtual account details for bank transfer funding.

**Response (success):**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "virtual_account": {
      "account_number": "7353333250",
      "bank_name": "Wema Bank",
      "email": "user@example.com",
      "is_active": true,
      "created_at": "2025-01-15T10:00:00Z"
    },
    "message": "Transfer any amount to this account to fund your wallet"
  }
}
```

**Response (not found):**
```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "error": {
    "code": "VIRTUAL_ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND",
    "message": "No virtual account found. Create one first."
  }
}
```

Create a static virtual account for the user.

**Prerequisites:**
- User must have complete profile (email, first name, last name)
- Valid BVN (11 digits)

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "bvn": "12345678901"
}
```

**BVN Requirements:**
- Must be exactly 11 digits
- Required by CBN (Central Bank of Nigeria) regulations
- Used for KYC verification

**Response (success):**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "virtual_account": {
      "account_number": "7353333250",
      "bank_name": "Wema Bank",
      "email": "user@example.com",
      "is_active": true,
      "created_at": "2025-01-15T10:00:00Z"
    },
    "message": "Virtual account created successfully. Transfer any amount to fund your wallet."
  }
}
```

**Response (profile incomplete):**
```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "error": {
    "code": "PROFILE_INCOMPLETE",
    "message": "Please complete your profile (email, first name, last name) before creating a virtual account"
  }
}
```

**Response (invalid BVN):**
```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "error": {
    "code": "INVALID_INPUT",
    "message": "bvn must be 11 characters"
  }
}
```

Mark user as having declined the virtual account creation prompt.

Call this when user dismisses/declines the VA creation prompt so it won't be shown again.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "message": "Virtual account creation declined"
  }
}
```

**Note:** User can still create a virtual account later by explicitly navigating to the creation flow.

Get all saved bank accounts for the user.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "bank_accounts": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "account_number": "0123456789",
        "account_name": "JOHN DOE",
        "bank_code": "044",
        "bank_name": "Access Bank",
        "is_default": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

Get list of Nigerian banks.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "banks": [
      {"id": 1, "code": "044", "name": "Access Bank"},
      {"id": 2, "code": "035", "name": "Wema Bank"}
    ]
  }
}
```

Verify bank account details before adding.

**Request Body:**
- `account_number`: 10-digit account number
- `bank_code`: Bank code from List Banks

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "account": {
      "account_number": "0123456789",
      "account_name": "JOHN DOE"
    }
  }
}
```

Get list of Nigerian banks.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": [
    {"id": 1, "code": "044", "name": "Access Bank"},
    {"id": 2, "code": "035", "name": "Wema Bank"},
    {"id": 3, "code": "232", "name": "Sterling Bank"}
  ]
}
```
